# The BLER baseline plots are ocudu-side deliverables (regenerable with plot_bler.py).

# Metal shader build artifacts: the .metallib libraries are regenerated IN PLACE in this
# source directory at build time (see CMakeLists.txt / cmake/modules/ocudu_metal.cmake),
# so they must never be committed again. The .air/.air.d intermediates stay in the build
# directory, but ignore them here too in case of a manual xcrun run.
*.metallib
*.air
*.air.d
